    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Dearnt Dibs.\nTokyo Jan 25\n'50\nAvrurd hink yesthday morning at 5 aim afth\na steples night on the plant to took the day\noff in order to rest - read accumulated mail -\nreview Amos Hiatt's file and sort of get my\nJust on the ground. This morning wint to the\noffice delured some presents - cute remembrancis\nWhich I hop you wort mind taking to my frinds\"\nfrom Ki Chun\nto miki mato. The \"etite puckaj\"\nwrighed ten groundo and file a large pager tack\nAlso vi ashero me to reture some prares to miki\nmats to trip for hi breams the latte comed nit\nfind the means of paying for them or ratte\nthe balance due which was#150° Itad lunch\nwith Dinnis he Even at a litte German restaraunt\nvery nice and thin came back has to the\nRate to to some tiger tick 3 mi\nTurayo is not coes but quite delightfue. s\nneed my our coat but its not as cold as\nParis and no snors.\nmt. Fuji is ellas and\nvisite most of the time - bout of court a\nlong way off.\nHou ten dia nit faint at the fight.\nmust go to dance now with Amos Itiate who\nis wile and chipper. Lots a loto of cour\ndarling. I do so hope you like Bangkoke-\nyour tac"
